{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29087","headline":"韶州韶阳楼夜讌 · 许浑","name":"韶州韶阳楼夜讌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"待月西楼卷翠罗，玉杯瑶瑟近星河。\n帘前碧树穷秋密，窗外青山薄暮多。\n鸜鹆未知狂客醉，鹧鸪先让美人歌。\n使君莫惜通宵饮，刀笔初从马伏波。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29087.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29087","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}